# Deliberately empty: when a directory has an .npmignore, npm stops reading its .gitignore,
# so the vendored Swift copies (OuoReplayCore/, OuoReplay/, OuoCrashCore/, OuoCrash/, written by scripts/sync-ios.mjs
# and gitignored) are included in the published tarball. Without them the CocoaPods specs
# would glob nothing and the installed module would be empty.
